# Output Directories
#
# Root-level run output is DUA-covered clinical data: a baseline run leaves 129
# per-case files NAMED by HADM_ID under Fold*/, and because they are EMPTY the
# pre-commit hook's content rule (20+ distinct HADM_IDs inside a file) cannot
# see them at all. The path rule is the only defence, so it must exist here.
#
# ANCHORED, and the leading slash is load-bearing (see the note further down
# about unanchored `entity/`): docs/Prediction_Output_* is the project's
# committed regression oracle and stays tracked precisely because these
# patterns only match at the repository root.
#
# Both spellings are kept on purpose. The baseline writes "Prediction Output_"
# with a SPACE, and any pre-rename SHA still emits it, so checking out an older
# commit and running it must not leave unignored clinical data behind.
/Prediction_Output_*/
/Prediction_Symptom_Details_*/
/Prediction Output_*/
/Prediction Symptom Details_*/
output/
results/

